    // (MAP_PRIVATE | MAP_ANONYMOUS, R+W). Runs once. The kernel hands back
    // the base, so the heap address is NOT derived from the linker's .bss
    // layout (issue #4081). %rdi (rounded size) is live; every register but
    // %rax/%rdi (the clobber contract) is saved across the syscall.
