    // Aborts with exit 134, matching the native backends + docs/ARRAY-BOUNDS.md
    // ("an out-of-bounds index aborts before producing a value; never returns a
    // garbage value"). A single shared routine keeps the per-access check to a
    // compare + a jae to here, with no per-site label churn.
    s = s.write("__fern_oob_abort:\n");
